{"4753790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chaos Club", "steam_appid": 4753790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4827980], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRESS FOR THE JOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/6827ee36172e46b57e5b0fed39eba664.poster.avif?t=1782075591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/6827ee36172e46b57e5b0fed39eba664.webm?t=1782075591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/6827ee36172e46b57e5b0fed39eba664.mp4?t=1782075591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Create your undercover security and step into the club looking like you totally belong there. Choose your look, blend into the party, and get ready to spot the people who are having a little too much fun for the wrong reasons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK THE DOOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/6c4eb70f38150db3775dd999bb4bd12a.poster.avif?t=1782075591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/6c4eb70f38150db3775dd999bb4bd12a.webm?t=1782075591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/6c4eb70f38150db3775dd999bb4bd12a.mp4?t=1782075591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The night starts at the entrance. Check the line, approve the guests, reject the suspicious ones, and try not to smile while sending someone home for being a walking disaster with accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP THE PARTY ALIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/87fa2b9f90850aa08d3add4e1e56a53c.poster.avif?t=1782075591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/87fa2b9f90850aa08d3add4e1e56a53c.webm?t=1782075591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/87fa2b9f90850aa08d3add4e1e56a53c.mp4?t=1782075591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Once the club opens, the impostors get to work. The DJ goes missing, the bartender disappears, the power cuts out, the cameras fail, and somehow you still need to keep drinks flowing, music playing, and everyone pretending this is normal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KICK OUT THE CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/059b6306a08689b04569fc7261b08597.poster.avif?t=1782075591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/059b6306a08689b04569fc7261b08597.webm?t=1782075591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753790/extras/059b6306a08689b04569fc7261b08597.mp4?t=1782075591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The deeper the night goes, the worse it gets. Fires spread, guests lose control, the mechanical bull becomes a problem, slap games go too far, and gunshots are a very bad review waiting to happen. Find the impostors and throw them out before the party collapses.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRESS FOR THE JOB</h2><p class=